   "body": "\n## Topics in the uploaded handouts\n\nThe uploaded handouts include information about:\n\n- Multigas meters\n- Photoionization detectors (PID)\n- Radiation survey meters\n- pH paper and test strips\n- Colorimetric tubes\n- M256 detection kits\n- Meter bump testing and calibration\n- IDLH atmospheres\n- Monitoring and detection limitations\n\n## Still to add\n\n- Create individual topic cards.\n- Each card should explain: what the instrument detects, what it does not detect, basic operational limitations, appropriate study vocabulary, why monitoring information affects risk assessment.\n- Do not provide instrument-specific operating instructions without the relevant manufacturer's guidance.\n\n## Sources\n\n- HazMat_Combined_Class_Handouts.pdf\n- Class brief 2026-11-03, Part 5 section 5\n"
